OL,3,CMass funeral held in Gaza for more
OL,4,Cthan 100 victims of 2023 Israeli strike
OL,6,FHuge crowds gathered at a mass funeral
OL,7,Fin Gaza on Tuesday for more than 100
OL,8,Fpeople killed in a deadly Israeli
OL,9,Fstrike in 2023 - one of the war's
OL,10,Fdeadliest attacks.
OL,12,FThe 112 victims, mostly women and
OL,13,Fchildren, were among more than 300
OL,14,Fkilled when Israeli warplanes
OL,15,Fflattened a residential block in the
OL,16,FSabra neighbourhood of Gaza City on
OL,17,FNovember 22, 2023.
OL,19,FThe block belonged to the Hassayna and
OL,20,FAbu Sharia families, and many victims
OL,21,Fwho lived there were related.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
