OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785887271
OL,3,CMass funeral held in Gaza for more
OL,4,Cthan 100 victims of 2023 Israeli strike
OL,6,FForty bodies were recovered at the
OL,7,Ftime, but most were buried deep under
OL,8,Fthe rubble.
OL,10,FOver the weekend, first responders
OL,11,Fretrieved the remains of a further 112
OL,12,Fvictims after digging through
OL,13,Fdestroyed buildings, said the Civil
OL,14,FDefence, first responders operating
OL,15,Funder the Hamas-run government.
OL,17,FIt said 157 bodies still have not been
OL,18,Ffound.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
