PN,30603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785887271
OL,3,CMass funeral held in Gaza for more
OL,4,Cthan 100 victims of 2023 Israeli strike
OL,6,F"The only crime of these martyrs was
OL,7,Fthat they remained steadfast and
OL,8,Fresilient in their homes, believing
OL,9,Fthat these homes would protect them,"
OL,10,FTaysir al-Hassayna, a relative of a
OL,11,Fvictim, told The Associated Press.
OL,13,FIt is only now that bodies from a
OL,14,Fstrike more than two and a half years
OL,15,Fago are slowly being found.
OL,17,FA fragile ceasefire took effect in
OL,18,FOctober last year, allowing recovery
OL,19,Fefforts to push ahead.
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@eO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/11
