OL,3,CMass funeral held in Gaza for more
OL,4,Cthan 100 victims of 2023 Israeli strike
OL,6,FAround 1,200 people were killed, and
OL,7,F251 were taken hostage in the Hamas-
OL,8,Fled militant attack on southern Israel
OL,9,Fon October 7, 2023.
OL,11,FIsrael's retaliatory offensive has
OL,12,Fkilled more than 73,377 Palestinians,
OL,13,Fincluding since the ceasefire, Gaza's
OL,14,FHamas-run Health Ministry said.
OL,16,FAt least 7,400 people have been
OL,17,Freported by relatives to still be
OL,18,Funder the rubble, Zaher al-Waheidi,
OL,19,Fhead of the ministry's records
OL,20,Fdepartment, told the Associated Press.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785887271
OL,3,CMass funeral held in Gaza for more
OL,4,Cthan 100 victims of 2023 Israeli strike
OL,6,FHe said the true number is likely
OL,7,Fthousands higher because in some cases
OL,8,Fentire families were killed in a
OL,9,Fsingle bombing, leaving no one to
OL,10,Freport the missing.
OL,12,FHundreds of people surrounded the
OL,13,Fbodies for funeral prayers at the mass
OL,14,Ffuneral on Tuesday, some standing on
OL,15,Fthe rubble.
OL,17,FThe remains of victims were wrapped in
OL,18,FPalestinian flags and laid in rows,
OL,19,Fmarked with photos and scattered with
OL,20,Fflower petals.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
