CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785887271
OL,3,CMass funeral held in Gaza for more
OL,4,Cthan 100 victims of 2023 Israeli strike
OL,6,FAfter prayers, the bodies were carried
OL,7,Fon stretchers along a narrow street
OL,8,Flined with what was left of buildings
OL,9,Fdestroyed in the war, before being
OL,10,Fburied in a local cemetery.
OL,12,FThe Associated Press, ITV News' US
OL,13,Fpartner, has identified at least 60
OL,14,Ffamilies across Gaza who lost 25 or
OL,15,Fmore family members during the first
OL,16,Fthree months of war.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
