OL,3,CMass funeral held in Gaza for more
OL,4,Cthan 100 victims of 2023 Israeli strike
OL,6,FAlthough fighting has decreased since
OL,7,Fthe ceasefire, at least 1,252 people
OL,8,Fhave been killed in Gaza since it took
OL,9,Feffect, according to its health
OL,10,Fministry.
OL,12,FThe ministry, which is part of the
OL,13,FHamas-led government, keeps detailed
OL,14,Fcasualty records that are seen as
OL,15,Fgenerally reliable by UN agencies and
OL,16,Findependent experts.
OL,18,FIt does not give a breakdown of
OL,19,Fcivilians and militants but says women
OL,20,Fand children make up most of the dead.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
