OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785887271
OL,3,CMass funeral held in Gaza for more
OL,4,Cthan 100 victims of 2023 Israeli strike
OL,6,FIsrael says its strikes are against
OL,7,Fmilitants who endanger its soldiers,
OL,8,Ftook part in the October 7 attack or
OL,9,Fcarry out other violations.
OL,11,FFive Israeli soldiers have been killed
OL,12,Fsince the ceasefire.
OL,14,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,15,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,16,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,17,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/11
