OL,3,CMass funeral held in Gaza for more
OL,4,Cthan 100 victims of 2023 Israeli strike
OL,6,FIn Gaza, most of the two million
OL,7,FPalestinians are displaced, and many
OL,8,Fare living in camps with overcrowding,
OL,9,Frodent infestations and outbreaks of
OL,10,Fdisease like chickenpox.
OL,12,FEach side has accused the other of
OL,13,Fviolating the ceasefire, and
OL,14,Fnegotiations on further steps have
OL,15,Flargely stalled.
OL,17,FDespite agreements to disarm, Hamas
OL,18,Fhas held onto its weapons, and the
OL,19,FIsraeli military has refused to
OL,20,Fwithdraw and controls over half the
OL,21,Fterritory.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
