CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785887271
OL,3,CMass funeral held in Gaza for more
OL,4,Cthan 100 victims of 2023 Israeli strike
OL,6,FNikolay Mladenov, the Board of Peace
OL,7,Fofficial overseeing Gaza's postwar
OL,8,Ftransition, met with Israeli Prime
OL,9,FMinister Benjamin Netanyahu on Monday
OL,10,Fto discuss a new disarmament deal the
OL,11,FUS-created board has reached with
OL,12,FHamas.
OL,14,FLast week, President Donald Trump
OL,15,Fannounced an agreement that calls for
OL,16,FIsrael to cease its military
OL,17,Foperations in Gaza and for Hamas and
OL,18,Fits allies there to halt all militant
OL,19,Factivity.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
